== Reward ==

<ul><li>  {{:Direwolf Fur Hood}}
</li></ul>

== Walkthrough ==

Ergrez will make you a Direwolf Fur Hood if you bring him a [[Low Quality Dire Wolf Fur]] and 2 [[Bark Bindings]].

You say, 'Hail, Ergrez Shortpaw' 
(no response) 

(handed in the items) 
Ergrez Shortpaw works with the fur for awhile by skinning it and sewing it.

There is no faction or experience associated with this quest.

[[Bark Bindings]] can be foraged in Wakening Lands.

